# Telemetry

| Attribute | Value |
|-----------|--------|
| Type | Rule |
| Audience | Telemetry and developer specialists |
| Adapt | Narrow `globs` to this repository's application folders if needed. |

- Implement **only** events in `features/{slug}/telemetry-contract.md`. If the
  contract says `EVENTS: none`, do not add analytics.
- Every event needs a specification FR/AC and a named business decision. No
  per-click vanity events.
- Allowlisted properties only. No email, tokens, passwords, raw prompts, or
  unconstrained free text.
- Use the structured logger already in this repository. Do not log full
  payloads.
- Do not add a third-party analytics SDK unless a Must FR names that vendor.
